@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
state "候补中" as Wait
state "待确认" as Pending
state "已报名" as Registered
state "已签到" as Checked
state "缺席" as Absent
state "已取消" as Cancelled

[*] --> Registered : 整单报名成功
[*] --> Wait : 余量不足且候补开放
Wait --> Pending : 队首整单可满足、通知发送成功
Pending --> Registered : 30分钟内确认
Pending --> Wait : 超时/释放预留并退队尾
Pending --> Cancelled : 主动放弃
Wait --> Cancelled : 主动取消/候补关闭/活动取消
Registered --> Cancelled : 整单取消/活动取消
Registered --> Checked : 至少一张票签到
Registered --> Absent : 场次结束且全未签到

@enduml
